      "id": "agent-observability",
      "name": "Agent-native observability: OpenTelemetry GenAI semantic conventions, eval harnesses and trace-based regression testing",
      "status": "Repricing the work",
      "note": "Every major harness now emits OpenTelemetry spans for tool calls, and two observability vendors price per agent step rather than per seat. Treat traces as the regression suite: replay last week's failing runs against every harness upgrade before you roll it out, and keep the replay set small enough to run in under ten minutes on a laptop, or nobody will run it. Every major harness now emits OpenTelemetry spans for tool calls, and two observability vendors price per agent step rather than per seat. Treat traces as the regression suite: replay last week's failing runs against every harness upgrade before you roll it out, and keep the replay set small enough to run in under ten minutes on a laptop, or nobody will run it. ",
